  "title": "Tyrolpath Adopts MSK-IMPACT®-Flex powered with SOPHiA DDM™ to Expand Precision Oncology in Austria",
  "summary": "🌍 We’re proud to highlight that Tyrolpath, the largest private pathology lab in western Austria, is the first lab in Austria to adopt MSK-IMPACT®-Flex powered with SOPHiA DDM™, marking a major milestone for precision oncology in the country. With approximately 45,000 new cancer diagnoses reported each year, there is a strong need for comprehensive genomic […]",
